{"id":"vod_sn_36426","vodId":"36426","provider":"sn","providerName":"索尼资源","type":2,"name":"核爆默示录","name_cn":"核爆默示录","date":"2013-01-01","year":"2013","region":"jp","area":"日本","platform":"日韩动漫","remarks":"已完结","images":{"common":"https://snzypic.vip/upload/vod/20230911-1/b49633cab13df0af76af9ed228949bd7.jpg"},"summary":"近未来，当年繁华喧嚣的东京因核电站事件变成了死城，被成为世界第一大幽灵城市。然而即便在这座死寂的废墟中，仍有幸村者盘桓于此。20XX年，三名没有配备任何防辐射装备的少女出现在旧东京。她们名叫成濑荆（户松遥 配音）、深作葵（花泽香菜 配音）、野村妙子（明坂聪美 配音），是通过遗传基因改造生下来天生具有抗辐射能力的少女，统称“COPPELION”。在防卫大学附属特别工科学校教官三岛鬼兵陆佐（小山力也 配音）的指挥下，少女们四处搜索幸存者，前所未有的经历以及感受接踵而至，少女们的心中作何感想……　　本片根据井上智德的漫画原作改编，COPPELION少女们的姓氏均来自日本著名导演，普通人姓氏则来自日本的文豪作家。","rating":{"score":0},"tags":[{"name":"日本动画"}],"sourceType":"third-party","updatedAt":"2023-09-11 15:43:05","playable":true,"episodeCount":13,"classic":true,"playGroups":[{"name":"snm3u8","episodes":[{"name":"第01集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/JvAkPAr15b1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第02集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/PJTt2m2Tv31/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第03集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/PnpeHp3LXS1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第04集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/K0MGhfwgvq1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第05集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/piiwxPni8v1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第06集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/C75wki3P8a1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第07集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/AqGmBKKxm01/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第08集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/qKn9idPJbB1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第09集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/rQRQ6hjb5Z1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第10集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/P0SvUDZrSV1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第11集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/JEFPE4fmVv1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第12集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/Td03Zfp0a61/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第13集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/hqX0DK7KJD1/video/index.m3u8"}]}],"snapshotAt":"2026-10-22T15:45:22.927Z"}